<title>UK: EBRD says Q1 operating profits 24 mln ECUs, up 1/3.</title>
<headline>EBRD says Q1 operating profits 24 mln ECUs, up 1/3.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Bank for Reconstruction and Development (EBRD) said on Wednesday that operating profits for the first quarter of 1997 has increased to 24.0 million ECUs, up one-third on the same period in 1996.</p>
<p>EBRD said in a statement that the figure was in line with earlier projections.</p>
<p>&quot;The outlook for 1997 remains cautiously optimistic,&quot; said Bart le Blanc, vice president, finance.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 4365</p>
